[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16682.551, "timestamp": "04:38:02", "text": "我想找一個更好的詞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16714.23, "timestamp": "04:38:34", "text": "。「[ __ ]」（混蛋）。不，「trucker」（卡車"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16731.83, "timestamp": "04:38:51", "text": "司機）太過了。「trucker」和「wood」（木頭）太接近了。不用「trucker 」。少了一件要擔心的事，對吧？好的，下一個。最後一個。"}]